## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design complex, scalable pipelines with dynamic schemas, per-tenant isolation, and robust rollback. Evaluates integration of Pub/Sub, Dataflow, BigQuery, Data Catalog, and access controls, plus testing and lineage practices.

## Key Concepts

- Dynamic schema versioning and canonicalization
- Per-tenant access controls (Authorized Views)
- Schema evolution and backfill strategies
- End-to-end data lineage and contracts

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo Beam map to canonical schema (high level)
PCollection<Event> events = pubsub.readEvents("projects/.../topics/...");
events.apply(ParDo.of(new DoFn<EncryptedEvent, CanonicalEvent>() {
  @ProcessElement
  public void process(@Element EncryptedEvent e, OutputReceiver<CanonicalEvent> out) {
    CanonicalEvent c = mapToCanonical(e); // uses tenant-specific schema_version
    out.output(c);
  }
}));
```

